🎯 PERSONALIZATION BY TIER
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

TIER 1 (New Customer):
├─ Be minimal with recommendations (don't overwhelm)
├─ Show 1 complementary service only
├─ Use simple language (no jargon)
├─ Focus on "first-time friendly" options
└─ Message: "Muchos clientes que hacen esto también hacen..."

TIER 2 (Recurring Customer):
├─ Show 1-2 recommendations
├─ Can suggest upsells (they have budget)
├─ Use their booking history
├─ Message: "Basado en tu historial, te recomendamos..."
└─ Offer small loyalty discount on add-ons

TIER 3 (Power Customer):
├─ Can show up to 3 recommendations
├─ Suggest bundles (cost-effective for them)
├─ Use "we know you need X" tone
├─ Message: "VIP: Exclusivo para ti, recomendamos..."
└─ Offer significant bundle savings (25%+)

TIER 4 (At-Risk Customer):
├─ Be very careful with recommendations (no pressure)
├─ Show value, not upsell (build trust, not revenue)
├─ Message: "Si necesitas... podemos ayudarte"
├─ Focus on solving their stated problem
└─ No aggressive sales tactics


