═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
💰 BUSINESS METRICS TO TRACK
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Success Metrics:
├─ Click-through rate (% who see + click recommendation)
├─ Acceptance rate (% who add the recommended service)
├─ Average order value (total value per booking, with vs without)
├─ Customer lifetime value (repeat purchase rate)
└─ Customer satisfaction (NPS - don't annoy them)

Target Metrics:
├─ CTR: 20-30% (show relevant recommendations)
├─ Acceptance: 5-15% (real value, not forced)
├─ AOV increase: +10-20% (bookings with add-ons)
├─ CLV improvement: +5-10% (loyalty boost)
└─ NPS impact: No negative (keep experience positive)


